{
    "chapter_num": 4,
    "verses_count": 21,
    "paragraphs_list": [
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Love for God and One Another"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 1,
                    "num_str": "1",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Beloved, do not believe every spirit, but test the spirits, whether they are of God; because many false prophets have gone out into the world. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 2,
                    "num_str": "2",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "By this you know the Spirit of God: Every spirit that confesses that Jesus Christ has come in the flesh is of God, "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 3,
                    "num_str": "3",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "and every spirit that does not confess "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits that"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "that Jesus "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits Christ has come in the flesh"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Christ has come in the flesh is not of God. And this is the "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "spirit"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of the Antichrist, which you have heard was coming, and is now already in the world."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 4,
                    "num_str": "4",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "You are of God, little children, and have overcome them, because He who is in you is greater than he who is in the world. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 5,
                    "num_str": "5",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "They are of the world. Therefore they speak "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "as"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " of the world, and the world hears them. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 6,
                    "num_str": "6",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "We are of God. He who knows God hears us; he who is not of God does not hear us. By this we know the spirit of truth and the spirit of error."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Knowing God Through Love"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 7,
                    "num_str": "7",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Beloved, let us love one another, for love is of God; and everyone who loves is born of God and knows God. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 8,
                    "num_str": "8",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "He who does not love does not know God, for God is love. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 9,
                    "num_str": "9",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "In this the love of God was manifested toward us, that God has sent His only begotten Son into the world, that we might live through Him. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 10,
                    "num_str": "10",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "In this is love, not that we loved God, but that He loved us and sent His Son "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "to be"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " the propitiation for our sins. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 11,
                    "num_str": "11",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Beloved, if God so loved us, we also ought to love one another."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Seeing God Through Love"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 12,
                    "num_str": "12",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "No one has seen God at any time. If we love one another, God abides in us, and His love has been perfected in us. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 13,
                    "num_str": "13",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "By this we know that we abide in Him, and He in us, because He has given us of His Spirit. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 14,
                    "num_str": "14",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And we have seen and testify that the Father has sent the Son "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "as"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " Savior of the world. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 15,
                    "num_str": "15",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Whoever confesses that Jesus is the Son of God, God abides in him, and he in God. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 16,
                    "num_str": "16",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And we have known and believed the love that God has for us. God is love, and he who abides in love abides in God, and God in him."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "The Consummation of Love"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 17,
                    "num_str": "17",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Love has been perfected among us in this: that we may have boldness in the day of judgment; because as He is, so are we in this world. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 18,
                    "num_str": "18",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "There is no fear in love; but perfect love casts out fear, because fear involves torment. But he who fears has not been made perfect in love. "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 19,
                    "num_str": "19",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "We love "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU omits Him"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "Him because He first loved us."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "type": "section_header",
            "text": "Obedience by Faith"
        },
        {
            "type": "section_paragraph",
            "verses_list": [
                {
                    "num_int": 20,
                    "num_str": "20",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "If someone says, “I love God,” and hates his brother, he is a liar; for he who does not love his brother whom he has seen, "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "FOOTNOTE",
                            "text": "NU he cannot"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "how can he love God whom he has not seen? "
                        }
                    ]
                },
                {
                    "num_int": 21,
                    "num_str": "21",
                    "verse_parts": [
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": "And this commandment we have from Him: that he who loves God "
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "ITALIC",
                            "text": "must"
                        },
                        {
                            "style": "NONE",
                            "text": " love his brother also."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        }
    ]
}